# {{ name }}

## Tasks

Run these from the repo root:
{% if kind == "app" %}
- `just start {{ name }}` starts the unit.{% endif %}
- `just build {{ name }}` builds the unit.
- `just test {{ name }}` runs the tests.
- `just lint` lints and type-checks every unit.
- `just format` formats every unit.

The task bodies come from `.moon/tasks/python.yml`.
